OL,4,BBellingham plays down Zidane           
OL,5,Bcomparison after wonder goal           
OL,6,GManager Jose Mourinho described Jude   
OL,7,GBellingham as "without any doubt, the  
OL,8,Gbest midfielder in the world"          
OL,9,Gfollowing a wonder goal which inspired 
OL,10,Ga brilliant second-half performance    
OL,11,Gfor Real Madrid in a 5-1 win against   
OL,12,GPSV.                                   
OL,14,FMourinho opted to leave the England    
OL,15,Fmidfielder out of the starting line-up 
OL,16,Ffor Tuesday's Champions League game at 
OL,17,Fthe Bernabeu - an understandable       
OL,18,Fdecision given the demands of Madrid's 
OL,19,Ffixture schedule and the strength in   
OL,20,Fdepth at his disposal.                 
